WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We're here with
Dr. Anthony Fauci.

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:06.272
You were played over the las
12 months by Brad Pitt on "SNL,"

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.074 line:92%
by Kate McKinnon on "SNL."

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:11.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had forgot -- I was
even in this sketch in 200

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.546 line:92%
during the anthrax scare.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.515 line:92%
You were played by Chris Kattan.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.583 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Let's take a quick look.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.651 line:92%
-What about the post offices

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.587 line:92%
