00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:40.473 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:44.277
-Now, Dr. Fauci, I guess
it probably is never good

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:47.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
